---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Santi Solís | Queerness Experiences" description={"Meet Santi Solís (they/them), a queer, Mexican former UCLA wildlife biologist who's called Tulum home since 2017 and founded Queerness Experiences."}>

<section class="guide" id="about" style="border-top:none;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div class="shape-y"></div>
  <div class="guide-inner" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--yellow);">About</p>
    <h2>I'm Santi.<br>Nice to meet you.</h2>
    <p class="guide-lead">Queer, Mexican, and a Tulum local since 2017. I create travel experiences for queer and trans people, rooted in the places and people that actually make this town special.</p>
    <div class="guide-photo">PHOTO — SANTI PORTRAIT</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="creds" aria-label="Credentials" style="background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);">
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">01</div><div><div class="ct">UCLA Wildlife Biologist</div><div class="cd">Former field biologist. The science behind every nature-based tour.</div></div></div>
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">02</div><div><div class="ct">Conference Speaker</div><div class="cd">Speaks on queer travel at international conferences, including IGLTA.</div></div></div>
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">03</div><div><div class="ct">Women's Day Speaker</div><div class="cd">Led a talk to 300+ women across Latin America on expanding their comfort zones.</div></div></div>
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">04</div><div><div class="ct">Committee Member, LADLE</div><div class="cd">Los Amigos de la Esquina. Started as an original volunteer, later general manager, now on committee.</div></div></div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);text-align:center;">
  <p style="max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);">I also work with hotels and destinations on LGBT inclusion. <a href="/work-with-me" style="color:var(--magenta);font-weight:700;">See how we could work together →</a></p>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;">
  <p class="sec-eye">My story</p>
  <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);">Born in Mexico, raised in the U.S., I moved to Tulum in 2017 and never looked back. Before this, I worked as a wildlife biologist at UCLA. Now I run travel experiences for queer and trans people who want the real Tulum, not a resort version of it.</p>
  <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);">Outside of tours, I'm part of a local theater group and take go-go dancing classes. I also serve on the committee for Los Amigos de la Esquina (LADLE), a local nonprofit offering art, wellbeing, and life-skills programs for Mayan and local Mexican kids. I started there as a volunteer, later became general manager, and now help guide the organization from the committee.</p>
  <div class="guide-photo">PHOTO — SANTI AT LADLE / COMMUNITY EVENT</div>
  <div class="guide-photo">PHOTO — SANTI AT A CONFERENCE OR SPEAKING EVENT</div>
  <div class="guide-photo">PHOTO — SANTI DOING A TOUR</div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--magenta);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);text-align:center;">
  <p style="max-width:520px;margin:0 auto var(--s-md);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--white);">Want to come explore Tulum with me?</p>
  <a href="/tours" class="btn-p" style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;margin:0 auto;">See the Tours →</a>
</section>

</Layout>
